              "LEV.4.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 4:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Ichikala chilongozi akahenda dambi bila kumanya kpwa kuvundza lagizo mwengarapho ra Mwenyezi Mlungu, Mlunguwe, andakala akahenda kosa vivyo, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.4.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.4.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 4:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "naye achimanyiswa dambi ariyoihenda, andareha sadakaye ya ndenje asiyekala na chirema. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.4.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.4.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 4:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Andaika mkpwonowe dzulu ya chitswa cha ndenje na kuitsindzira phatu atsindzirapho sadaka za kuochwa mbere za Mwenyezi Mlungu. Iyo ni sadaka ya kuusa dambi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.4.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.4.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 4:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mlavyadzi-sadaka andadyoga chalache kpwenye milatso ya sadaka ya kuusa dambi na kuipaka kpwenye hizo pembe zirizo kpwenye pembe za phatu pha kulavira sadaka za kuochwa. Milatso ndiyosala andaimwaga photsi kpwenye hako ra phatu pha kulavira sadaka za kuochwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.4.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.4.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 4:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Marunya gosi ga ndenje hiye andagaocha dzulu ya phatu pha kulavira sadaka, dza vira arivyohenda marunya ga nyama wa sadaka ya amani. Kpwa hivyo mlavyadzi-sadaka andamuhendera chilongozi upatanisho kpwa kumuusira dambi, naye andaswamehewa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.4.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.4.26"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
