          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na ndiphomanyiswa kukala akahenda dambi, andareha sadaka ya mbuzi chetu isiyokala na chirema kpwa ajili ya kuusira dambi ariyohenda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.4.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.4.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 4:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Andaika mkpwonowe dzulu ya chitswa cha mbuzi iyo ya sadaka ya kuusa dambi na kuitsindzira phatu atsindzirapho nyama a sadaka za kuochwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.4.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.4.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 4:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mlavyadzi-sadaka andadyoga chalache kpwenye milatso ya sadaka ya kuusa dambi na kuipaka kpwenye hizo pembe zirizo kpwenye pembe za phatu pha kulavira sadaka ya kuochwa. Milatso ndiyosala andaimwaga photsi kpwenye hako ra phatu pha kulavira sadaka. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.4.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.4.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 4:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ye mutu achiyereha yo sadaka andausa marunya gosi ga mbuzi hiye dza vira anavyousa marunya ga nyama a sadaka ya amani, naye mlavyadzi-sadaka andagaocha dzulu ya phatu pha kulavira sadaka, na harufuye nono indamhamira Mwenyezi Mlungu. Phahi, mlavyadzi-sadaka andamuhendera yuya mutu upatanisho kpwa kumuusira dambi, naye andaswamehewa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.4.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.4.31"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
